From 4312707fa574e61db43fcd1f09acb8731ea85070 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ashforde=20O=C3=9C?= <ashfordegithub@cbaweja.org>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:04:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Kshana Desktop (L2a): the Studio in a native window with
 native runs

apps/desktop: a Tauri 2 application whose window shows web/studio unchanged. Runs,
charts, tables, the localised text, the kind list, the examples and the CCSDS and SP3
exports go to the engine linked natively (src-tauri/src/bridge.rs, the same engine
calls as src/wasm.rs) off the window's thread; the tool pages keep the WebAssembly
engine in the same window. Native commands read files of any size in blocks and probe
an IQ recording without reading it whole (tested on a 1 GiB file). web/studio picks the
Desktop client only inside the app (lib/desktop.mjs, tested with node).

Builds and tests on Linux; a desktop workflow builds and bundles on Linux, macOS and
Windows. Unsigned: signing and notarisation need the publisher's accounts.
